        <detaileddescription>
<para>Install the default 4-dimensional deterministic embed function and reset the embed call counter.</para>
<para>The function produces a one-hot basis vector based on <computeroutput>std::hash&lt;std::string&gt;</computeroutput> so that distinct texts reliably map to distinct (or at worst the same) 4-dim unit vector — deterministic across a single test run. </para>
